  rcases le_total s.im 7 with g6 | g6
  · exact zeta_ne_zero_s6 s h0 h1 h2 g6
  rcases le_total s.im 8 with g7 | g7
  · exact zeta_ne_zero_s7 s h0 h1 g6 g7
